WEBVTT

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:04.110
What's going to happen to us?

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:08.870
It's after the boat!

00:02:09.550 --> 00:02:11.140
Hey! Menori!

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:48.160
Howard, let's go back!

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:50.860
Stay back! Stay back!

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:54.140
Stay away!

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:06.660
Howard!

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:11.050
We're going back.

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:17.610
--Go for it!
--Keep going!

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:22.660
Both of you, keep going! Both of you!

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:33.360
You... you... you!

00:03:38.370 --> 00:03:40.880
It's useless! Let's concentrate on rowing!

00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:43.170
Shut up! Don't distract me!

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:51.610
Everyone, get back inside the shuttle.

00:03:52.110 --> 00:03:52.880
But Luna, what about you?

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:55.430
I'm going to help them get back.

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:57.490
So you take shelter.

00:03:58.660 --> 00:03:59.870
I'll help too.

00:04:02.030 --> 00:04:02.630
Please.

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:04.190
Now, everyone!

00:04:04.670 --> 00:04:07.150
Like Luna says! Everyone, quick!

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:15.120
Kaoru, take care of Sharla and Shingo.

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:42.100
How's that? Did you see?

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:43.240
Row!

00:04:58.070 --> 00:04:59.220
A little further!

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:01.360
Keep it up!

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:02.420
This way!

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:09.910
Behind you!

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:57.640
Howard! Howard!

00:05:57.870 --> 00:05:59.890
This way! This way!

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:11.440
Menori, you go in ahead.

00:06:12.770 --> 00:06:13.640
But...

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:15.640
It's okay.

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:17.670
Very well.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:19.020
I'll wait up top.

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:37.260
Hurry!

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:31.560
What is that thing?

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:34.280
Chako, do you know?

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:38.720
That monster ain't in my data.

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:42.360
So this isn't Earth after all.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:45.720
What's going to happen to us?

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:48.060
Are we going to die here like this?

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:50.840
Sharla, it's okay.

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:57.170
Sorry.

00:07:58.300 --> 00:08:01.070
Anyways, the first problem is reaching shore.

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:02.310
You're right.

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:05.440
And then we have to make sure there's water and food.

00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:09.170
Shingo, don't you have some trick up your sleeve?

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:14.720
If we get the shuttle loose from the atoll...

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:18.060
...and ride the waves, I think we can make it to land.

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:22.210
That's impossible without a crane!

00:08:23.220 --> 00:08:24.940
If we don't try, we won't know.

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:26.460
Yeah, yeah.

00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:29.410
The tide will be coming in from now on.

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:33.380
When it does, it'll be easier to float.

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:34.170
Good.

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:37.600
We'll wait for the tide to come in,
and all try it together.

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:02.050
Not yet?

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:06.620
A little longer.

00:09:10.390 --> 00:09:12.310
Is it okay to drink like that?

00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:17.200
I'll manage somehow.

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:20.370
We let everyone take care of their own drinking.

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.650
You're the only one who'll be
in trouble when you run out.

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:48.190
How is it?

00:09:49.490 --> 00:09:50.350
It doesn't seem to be here.

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:13.000
Ready, set...

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:25.170
This is impossible!

00:10:25.990 --> 00:10:27.590
Keep your voice down!

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:29.740
Let's try it again.

00:10:31.090 --> 00:10:31.540
Okay.

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:35.310
Maybe it'll be better if I'm in the middle.

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:44.560
Yes, please.

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:52.810
Ready, set...

00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:20.760
It moved!

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:28.000
Crap! He noticed!

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:31.900
Everyone, come back!

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:37.130
I'll get you this time!

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:49.060
Crap! Get inside fast!

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:53.410
Howard, hurry!

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:02.070
Go!

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.320
And we were so close...

00:12:28.990 --> 00:12:30.920
I wonder if that hatch will hold.

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:32.950
I don't know.

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:35.670
I think it should be strong enough, though.

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:08.820
The hinge!

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:11.090
It'll be bad if he starts aimin' for it!

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:22.580
What's it doing?

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:14.460
That bastard...

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:14.950
Stop!

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:16.300
You'll puncture the hull!

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:24.830
I told you to stop!

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:27.490
It's fine if I hit him!

00:14:32.690 --> 00:14:33.810
Damn you!

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:36.570
It's out of energy!

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:20.500
Stay away!

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:26.930
Sharla!

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:48.290
Luna!

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.590
Oh no! Luna's in danger!

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:33.980
Bell!

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:37.810
Damn it!

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:19.040
Luna!

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:21.270
Are you okay?

00:17:28.340 --> 00:17:29.800
Bell, thank you.

00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:32.010
Sharla, are you hurt?

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:41.420
Kaoru...

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:43.660
Thank you.

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:53.870
We're floating. This shuttle's floating on the sea!

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:02.860
Here it comes!

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:16.020
Put the hatch back like it was!

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:20.860
Over here.

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:22.840
Hey!

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:11.740
A little further!

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:25.490
We've landed!

00:19:26.090 --> 00:19:27.770
What a relief!

00:19:31.990 --> 00:19:33.270
Where's that strange creature?

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:34.860
I'll check.

00:19:38.710 --> 00:19:41.520
Because that monster's body was huge...

00:19:41.930 --> 00:19:43.690
...it couldn't come into the shallows.

00:19:44.350 --> 00:19:45.250
It seems so.

00:19:52.190 --> 00:19:53.050
Should we get out?

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:57.420
We don't know what kind of dangerous
creatures there may be on land either.

00:19:58.340 --> 00:20:00.190
We'll spend tonight in the shuttle.

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:01.600
What did you say?

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:03.980
We're not getting out?

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:09.380
Making sure we're not drawn out
to sea by the ebb tide is our first priority.

00:20:24.290 --> 00:20:25.990
Okay! We're finished mooring!

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:45.320
That's a real pretty sunset!

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:49.360
It's amazing!

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:52.710
It's a real sunset.

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:56.840
Oh yeah. It's everyone's first time seein' a real sunset.

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:11.860
We don't know if we'll be
able to find food or water tomorrow.

00:21:12.890 --> 00:21:15.420
So think it over carefully before you eat your dinner.

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:24.550
Bell, give me a little water.

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:25.790
Howard!

00:21:27.210 --> 00:21:28.540
You don't hafta do that.

00:21:28.920 --> 00:21:30.060
It's his just desserts.

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:31.860
Shut it, you.

00:21:32.590 --> 00:21:33.460
What's the problem?

00:21:34.280 --> 00:21:36.120
I'm thirsty and I didn't save any.

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:38.970
Then you should have
controlled yourself like I said.

00:21:39.320 --> 00:21:40.960
You've got that in the wrong order.

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:45.770
I never heard anything about
waiting until tomorrow to get out back then.

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:46.690
But...

00:21:46.940 --> 00:21:48.680
...everyone was on equal terms.

00:21:49.150 --> 00:21:50.330
I don't mind.

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:52.710
I'm not all that thirsty.

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:54.310
Thank you!

00:22:51.460 --> 00:22:52.540
What is this?

00:23:02.370 --> 00:23:09.120
It's bad! I thought we got away from the sea snake, but another unknown creature bent the shuttle!

00:23:09.720 --> 00:23:11.710
What's happening here?

00:23:12.100 --> 00:23:14.610
Luna, Sharla's actin' weird.

00:23:15.170 --> 00:23:17.350
Sharla, what happened?

00:23:17.590 --> 00:23:18.720
Cheer up!

00:23:19.040 --> 00:23:22.730
No matter what happens,
as long as I'm here, you'll be fine.

00:23:23.160 --> 00:23:23.930
Okay?

00:23:25.790 --> 00:23:28.520
Next time: Sharla, you can't give up!
